{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Junkyard Rush Racing",
    "steam_appid": 3363510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junkyard Rush Racing</strong> evokes the rugged charm of southern US style daredevil racing, inspired by the adventurous spirit of &quot;<i>Dukes of Hazzard</i>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players navigate through diverse environments, including dusty desert roads, ramshackle junkyards, and winding country lanes. Race opponents, complete time trials, participate in tournaments in single player - or challenge a friend for a cutthroat couch multiplayer session!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junkyard Rush Racing is an arcade car racer with <strong>16 upgradeable and customizable vehicles</strong> and <strong>12 tracks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have the option to race AI opponents either in a single race or a tournament format, as well as other players via split screen multiplayer. Additionally, players can try to beat their own time on all available tracks in a time trial game mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament</strong> - play multiple rounds against the same opponents. Gain tournament points each round in 3 modes (Race, Elimination and Time Trial).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race</strong> - play a simple round on a chosen track against 5 opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong> - Beat set track times, or your own best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotseat</strong> - Challenge your friends for a round of split screen multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junkyard Rush Racing challenges your ability to learn the optimal maneuvering strategies for each track, engage opponents in an intense competition, with a limited nitro booster ability that can be strategically deployed for an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your difficulty between <strong>Easy</strong>, <strong>Medium</strong> and <strong>Hard</strong>\u00a0modes for a preferred racing experience against AI controlled opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your view to <strong>3rd person</strong>, <strong>FPS</strong> or <strong>close up</strong> mode - whatever fits your racing style the best!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junkyard Rush Racing</strong> evokes the rugged charm of southern US style daredevil racing, inspired by the adventurous spirit of &quot;<i>Dukes of Hazzard</i>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players navigate through diverse environments, including dusty desert roads, ramshackle junkyards, and winding country lanes. Race opponents, complete time trials, participate in tournaments in single player - or challenge a friend for a cutthroat couch multiplayer session!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junkyard Rush Racing is an arcade car racer with <strong>16 upgradeable and customizable vehicles</strong> and <strong>12 tracks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have the option to race AI opponents either in a single race or a tournament format, as well as other players via split screen multiplayer. Additionally, players can try to beat their own time on all available tracks in a time trial game mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament</strong> - play multiple rounds against the same opponents. Gain tournament points each round in 3 modes (Race, Elimination and Time Trial).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race</strong> - play a simple round on a chosen track against 5 opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong> - Beat set track times, or your own best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotseat</strong> - Challenge your friends for a round of split screen multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junkyard Rush Racing challenges your ability to learn the optimal maneuvering strategies for each track, engage opponents in an intense competition, with a limited nitro booster ability that can be strategically deployed for an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your difficulty between <strong>Easy</strong>, <strong>Medium</strong> and <strong>Hard</strong>\u00a0modes for a preferred racing experience against AI controlled opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your view to <strong>3rd person</strong>, <strong>FPS</strong> or <strong>close up</strong> mode - whatever fits your racing style the best!</p>",
